    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just esoteric stuff though. if you look at the actual math of the radiating elements (the avenues acting as dipole arms), the scale of the city actually lines up with specific wavelengths. i'm trying to figure out what the resonant frequency would be if the whole central nexus was tuned to a transmission. if we assume the primary axis length is the wavelength, can you help me calculate what frequency that would correspond to?",
